{
  "context": "Add a fail-closed ancestry check to Makefile pr-open. Cover it with a unit or make-recipe test that a behind HEAD is refused and a current HEAD proceeds to the existing push/create path. Update the pr-open help text and repo-admin runbook. Do not change auto-merge arming, GitHub settings, or refresh-shadow.",
